%% CodeVortex — Master Execution Sequence (Mermaid)
%% Paste into https://mermaid.live — vertical lifelines = services, horizontal arrows = execution steps
%% This is the single master diagram; see docs/engineering/execution-flow.md for per-scenario breakdowns

sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser<br/>(Monaco/xterm/Redux)
    participant SIO as Socket.IO
    participant API as Express API
    participant Redis
    participant Docker as Docker Engine
    participant Container as Ephemeral Container<br/>(--network=none, 128m, pids 50)
    participant Mongo as MongoDB
    participant Gemini as Gemini 2.5 Flash

    Note over Browser,Gemini: 0) Bootstrap & Auth
    Browser->>API: POST /api/auth/login {email, password}
    API->>Mongo: findOne users {email}
    Mongo-->>API: user + hash
    API-->>Browser: 200 {JWT 7d}
    Browser->>SIO: io(SOCKET_URL) WS handshake
    SIO-->>Browser: 101 Switching Protocols

    Note over Browser,Mongo: 1) Open & Edit File
    Browser->>API: GET /api/files/:path/content (Bearer JWT)
    API->>Mongo: find file {projectId, path}
    Mongo-->>Browser: {content}
    Browser->>Browser: Monaco onChange → Redux updateFileContent + dirty ●
    Browser->>API: PUT /api/files/:path/content {content} (autosave 2s / Ctrl+S)
    API->>Mongo: updateOne {content, size}
    Mongo-->>Browser: 200 {success}

    Note over Browser,Container: 2) Execute — Happy Path (streamed, isolated)
    Browser->>SIO: exec:start {code, language, stdin?, projectId, idempotencyKey}
    SIO->>API: auth + validate (allowlist, <100KB)
    API->>Redis: INCR rate:exec:{userId}:hour (30/hr)
    API->>Redis: SET process:{id} {status:queued} TTL 30m
    SIO-->>Browser: exec:started {processId}
    Browser->>SIO: join room process:{id}
    API->>Docker: createContainer {Image: code-runner:{lang}, NetworkMode:none, Memory:128m, Cpus:0.5, PidsLimit:50, ReadonlyRootfs:true, Tmpfs:/tmp 10m, User:1000, CapDrop:ALL}
    Docker->>Container: start + attach stdout/stderr
    Container-->>Docker: stdout chunk "Hello\n"
    Docker-->>API: demux stream
    API->>Redis: RPUSH process:buffer:{id} chunk + LTRIM 0 999
    API->>SIO: exec:output {processId, chunk, stream:stdout}
    SIO-->>Browser: render chunk live
    Container-->>Docker: exit 0
    Docker-->>API: wait → StatusCode 0
    API->>Mongo: insert execution_logs {exitCode:0, durationMs}
    API->>Redis: SET process:{id} {status:done, exitCode:0}
    API->>SIO: exec:done {processId, exitCode:0, duration}
    SIO-->>Browser: green success
    API->>Docker: rm container (--rm)

    Note over Browser,Container: 3) Compiled Language (Java/C/C++) — compile then run inside same container
    Browser->>SIO: exec:start {language:java, code:"public class Main..."}
    SIO->>Docker: sh -c "cat > /tmp/Main.java <<'EOF' ... && javac /tmp/Main.java && java -cp /tmp Main"
    alt javac error
        Container-->>SIO: exec:output stderr "cannot find symbol"
        Container-->>SIO: exec:done exit 1 (no run)
    else javac ok
        Container-->>SIO: exec:output stdout (run output)
        Container-->>SIO: exec:done exit 0
    end

    Note over Browser,Container: 4) Timeout & Kill
    Browser->>SIO: exec:start {code:"while True: pass"}
    SIO->>Docker: run (cpus 0.5 caps spin)
    API->>API: setTimeout 15s
    API->>Docker: kill SIGKILL
    API->>SIO: exec:timeout {processId}
    SIO-->>Browser: toast Timed out 15s
    Note over Browser,Container: User kill: Browser->>SIO: exec:kill {processId} → Docker kill → exec:done killed

    Note over Browser,Container: 5) Mid-execution stdin (input()/scanf)
    Browser->>SIO: exec:start {code: name=input('Name#58; ') print(name)}
    Container-->>SIO: exec:output 'Name#58; ' blocks on read
    SIO-->>Browser: show inline stdin input
    Browser->>SIO: process:stdin {processId, data:"Alice\n"}
    SIO->>Container: stdin.write "Alice\n"
    Container-->>SIO: exec:output "Alice\n"
    Container-->>SIO: exec:done exit 0

    Note over Browser,Container: 6) Terminal PTY (xterm.js + node-pty)
    Browser->>SIO: term:start {projectId, cols:80, rows:24}
    SIO->>Docker: run -it + volume workspace-{userId}-{projectId}:/workspace
    SIO->>SIO: pty.spawn docker exec -it {id} /bin/bash
    SIO-->>Browser: term:ready {sessionId}
    Browser->>SIO: term:input {sessionId, data:"ls\r"}
    SIO->>Container: pty.write → bash executes
    Container-->>SIO: term:output ANSI "file.py\r\n$ "
    SIO-->>Browser: xterm write (colors, cursor)
    Browser->>SIO: term:resize {cols:120, rows:30}
    SIO->>Container: pty.resize → SIGWINCH
    Browser->>SIO: term:stop {sessionId}
    SIO->>Docker: kill container
    SIO->>Redis: DEL terminal:{sessionId}

    Note over Browser,Gemini: 7) Image → Code (OCR)
    Browser->>API: POST /api/ocr/extract-code {image b64, mimeType}
    API->>Redis: INCR rate:ocr:{userId}:day (10/day)
    API->>Gemini: generateContent vision {prompt JSON {language,code}, inlineData}
    Gemini-->>API: {language, code}
    API-->>Browser: 200 {language, code} → popup preview → Run

    Note over Browser,Gemini: 8) AI Chat (SSE streaming)
    Browser->>API: POST /api/ai/chat SSE {message, activeFile 0..8000, stderr 0..2000, history 10}
    API->>Redis: rate ai_chat 100/day
    API->>Gemini: generateContentStream(context)
    loop chunks
        Gemini-->>API: chunk.text()
        API-->>Browser: SSE data: {"text": chunk}
    end
    API-->>Browser: SSE data: [DONE]

    Note over Browser,Redis: 9) Reconnect & Crash Recovery
    Browser->>SIO: exec:reconnect {processId}
    SIO->>Redis: GET process:{processId} + LRANGE buffer
    SIO-->>Browser: replay buffered chunks
    alt still running
        SIO-->>Browser: rejoin room → live resume
    else done/timeout
        SIO-->>Browser: exec:done {exitCode}
    end
    Note over API,Docker: On API restart: SCAN process:* → kill orphans older than 2×timeout → mark crashed
